        "alert": "yes", "breathing_issues": "no", "urination_8h": "yes",
        "drinking": "no", "current_medication": null, "medication_last_dose": null,
        "rash": null, "neck_pain": null, "fever_duration_days": null
      },
      "expected_is_complete": false,
      "notes": "The non-overwrite rule applies to null (don't erase with null). A new explicit value SHOULD overwrite the old one. drinking must update from 'yes' to 'no'. vomiting should remain true (already set, 'threw up' confirms but doesn't change it — extracted as null to avoid redundant set)."
